				<r3d:description language="eng">Online materials database (known as PAULING FILE project) with nearly 2 million entries: physical properties, crystal structures, phase diagrams, available via API, ready for modern data-intensive applications. The source of these entries are about 0.5M peer-reviewed publications in materials science, processed during the last 30 years by an international team of PhD editors. The results are presented online with a quick search interface. The basic access is provided for free.</r3d:description>
